{"id":"n51125-4-6","stage":5,"title":"들어앉다 · 闲在家","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51125-4-6-1","ko":"이제 일을 그만두고 집에서 애들을 돌보는 게 좋지 않겠어?","zh":"现在不如辞掉工作，在家照顾孩子吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두고","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두고","audio":"/audio/f30a0252b08903bab4ef.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"애들을","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들을","audio":"/audio/03f4fbef9455d2127b8d.mp3"}},{"text":"돌보는","meaning":"照顾，照看","explanation":"돌보다：照顾，照看；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"돌보다","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61310","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌보는","audio":"/audio/a7db45c0018729eed195.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋지","meaning":"合适，适用","explanation":"좋다：合适，适用；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"19","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋지","audio":"/audio/93fe8dafc60040a28c9b.mp3"}},{"text":"않겠어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않겠어","audio":"/audio/667df324af8a56e4f094.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"bb6524970702f93b","term":"돌보다","zh":"照顾，照看","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3","entryId":"61310","definition":"对某个对象关心并保护照顾。","pronunciation":["돌ː보다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"合适，适用","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"适合用于某种材料或某件事情。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/acfd7c8e37243cfbf1e4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n51125-4-6-2","ko":"아니, 갑자기 집에 들어앉으라니요?","zh":"不行啊，怎么能突然让我待在家里呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"들어앉으라니요?","meaning":"闲在家，闷在家","explanation":"들어앉다：闲在家，闷在家；으라니：对听到的命令、要求表示惊讶或质问：“竟然让我……？”；加 요 时为礼貌表达；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"들어앉다","audio":"/audio/dc52990bb6e74cb9046d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51125","senseId":"4","lemma":"들어앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어앉으라니요","audio":"/audio/b4b7380f33b079d93f83.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"dc52990bb6e74cb9","term":"들어앉다","zh":"闲在家，闷在家","audio":"/audio/dc52990bb6e74cb9046d.mp3","entryId":"51125","definition":"停止外面的活动，呆在家里。","pronunciation":["드러안따"]}],"audio":"/audio/82617924aaeef79cbaac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.489,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=51125","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3157,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不行啊，怎么能突然让我待在家里呢？","现在不如辞掉工作，在家照顾孩子吧？","为什么要用硬币堆塔又推倒呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在不如辞掉工作，在家照顾孩子吧？","为什么要用硬币堆塔又推倒呢？","不行啊，怎么能突然让我待在家里呢？"],"answer":2}]}
